*EXP. DATA (T): Heinen (1999) Exp 6705 NFT Lettuce - Wageningen

! EPAC = cumulative plant transpiration (mm); added 2026-08-04 from Heinen
!        1994 (Rapport 1, exp 6705) Table 3.7 "Cumulative weekly transpiration
!        per plant, T (l)". Converted L/plant -> mm using PPOP=15.6 plants/m2
!        (mm = L/plant * PPOP, since 1 mm = 1 L/m2 ground area). DAP0 row has
!        no reported value (Heinen's table starts at week 1). Simulated EPAC
!        was found to run at only ~10-16% of these observed values across the
!        season -- see WAGA9101.WTH, whose SRAD is flat at 7.0 MJ/m2/d for all
!        62 days (implausible for a real greenhouse; Heinen Fig 3.1/3.8 show
!        real day-to-day variation averaging ~14 MJ/m2/d, read off the axis).
